# Keep host artifacts out of the image build context. Measured 2026-09-05 on a
# Windows node: a 613 MB host node_modules (win32 esbuild binary) was COPY'd
# into the Linux builder and `vite build` died in esbuild's service spawn.
# The image is built from the lockfile inside the builder, on any host.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
**/.turbo
**/.cache
